WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
No, no, Master, you think too much

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:05,160
Gu Yuan, this matter is my problem after all

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,160
Sometimes you should learn to be angry

4
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:09,720
Suffering from anger will only make them worse

5
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:13,340
Sometimes appropriate tough measures can be used to safeguard one's own rights and interests

6
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:14,580
It really doesn't matter

7
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:18,100
With my talent, it would be great if I could cultivate to the third level in this life.

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,900
That Tu Jiarong is so talented

9
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,300
After Chi Xiao’s great writing, he will definitely be born as a disciple of foreigners

10
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,860
It's not like I can resist

11
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,380
Besides, after all, we are all from the same school.

12
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:28,500
If a few strains of spiritual matter can resolve the conflict

13
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,820
Isn't this a good thing?

14
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:39,500
Anyway, as long as you're fine

15
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,260
Gu Yuan is indeed a good person

16
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:44,660
On the contrary, Tu Jiarong was bullying Jiarong in this battle.

17
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:46,060
If you can't let it go

18
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:48,460
I'm afraid it'll get on my head too

19
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:50,020
Gotta find a way to deal with it
